WEBVTT

00:05:28.616 --> 00:05:32.244
it's pretty hard to get people
to try my food.

00:05:32.286 --> 00:05:35.039
(Laughter)

00:05:35.081 --> 00:05:40.169
You tell someone something's vegan
and you're already met with skepticism.

00:05:40.211 --> 00:05:43.798
Tell them it’s vegan and you pulled
half of it out of the ground ...

00:05:43.839 --> 00:05:46.008
(Laughter)

00:05:46.008 --> 00:05:47.551
It's a tough sell.

00:05:48.969 --> 00:05:53.766
So today I'm going to give
all of you my tips, my tricks

00:05:53.808 --> 00:05:56.685
on getting people to expand their palette

00:05:56.685 --> 00:05:59.438
and try wild vegan foods consensually.

00:05:59.772 --> 00:06:02.149
(Laughter)